5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit nervous to start. I just want to make sure the room can actually handle whatever we bring in.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Structural integrity is non-negotiable. We must verify the bay’s capacity before considering any heavy installations.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"But what about the people? If the room is safe, who actually lifts the boxes? I want to know who is working!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about the delivery trucks getting stuck again! Let’s check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs to avoid last-minute chaos.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the structural focus, but I’m curious about the financials. Let’s examine the loan transport costs over three seasons to see where the money actually goes.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m still a bit quiet, but I think we should look at the structural survey of the suspended bay.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the five years of visitor comment slips. The record must speak before we commit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I’m picking the volunteer roster and conservation lab staffing! I need to know exactly who is showing up to help, not just who is on paper.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I’ll also check the maintenance log for powered displays. I want to see where things actually broke down, not just what the schedule promised.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the mount-making charges and joiner’s rate. I need to know exactly where the fabrication budget vanishes before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’d also like to check the evening hire bookings. I need to know if the room is already spoken for before we promise it to an exhibition.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also review the weekend head counts across ten seasons. Attendance patterns reveal what truly resonates with the public.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m also checking the maintenance log for powered displays! I want to see if the machines actually work or if they just sit there broken.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I’m also checking the weekend head counts across ten seasons. I want to see if people actually show up, not just what the brochures promise.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll also look at the conservation lab staffing and backlog. I need to know if we can actually process the loans before the season starts.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think I’m done for now. I’ll wait to hear what everyone finds out before I say anything else.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I have my selections. I will review the findings before offering further opinion.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’m done picking! I can’t wait to see who is actually working. Bye for now!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m all set! Can’t wait to see what we find. Let’s hope the trucks don’t get stuck this time!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’m finished for now. Let’s see if the numbers match the promises before we spend another penny.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
