35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the bay caps at four hundred kilos. Also, the room is booked six evenings a season. We need to plan around that.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The data is clear. People return for presence and movement, not static cases. We must prioritize exhibits that offer interaction.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, wait! The powered displays broke down four times while people were watching! Who actually fixes them?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that’s bad! But I found two past openings slipped because paperwork arrived late. We must check shipping cut-offs early to avoid apologizing at the door.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, late paperwork is a nuisance, but my findings are worse. The joiner’s rate jumped fifty percent, and the lab is drowning in two hundred pieces.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, that backlog worries me. If the lab is overwhelmed, we can’t risk damaging the room’s structure with rushed work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, the backlog is a symptom. The root cause is selecting exhibits that demand excessive conservation effort over simple, engaging presence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, two hundred pieces? But my roster is mostly history walkers! Who is actually doing the heavy lifting?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that’s scary! But my head counts show people love moving displays. We just need to fix the delivery mess first so the trucks don’t get stuck again!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the lab is effectively one person. @Toshio, I agree: we need objects that don’t require bespoke mounts. Let’s prioritize self-supporting pieces to save the budget.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I worry about the weight limit. If we choose heavy items, the floor might fail. We must keep the load light.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the four-hundred-kilo limit is a constraint, not a barrier. We select lightweight, self-supporting pieces that still offer the presence the data demands.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, one person? That’s impossible! My volunteers are just walkers. Who is actually standing in the room to help people?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that’s tough! But my data says people love moving displays. We just need to fix the delivery mess first so the trucks don’t get stuck again!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the volunteers are for the floor, not the lab. We simply cannot afford the fabrication costs for complex mounts right now.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m still quiet, but I agree. We must respect the weight limit and the evening bookings. Let’s choose something light and simple.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I concur. The evidence points to a specific direction. We need a lightweight, interactive installation that respects the structural limits and the staffing reality.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I’m done! I just need to know who is actually standing in the room. Bye!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m done too! Let’s hope the paperwork arrives on time this season. I’m ready to see the candidates!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m done. The numbers are grim, but the path is clear. Let’s see if the candidates can survive the reality check.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
